cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: ikn-library
abstract: >-
  A Python library of nature-inspired metaheuristic algorithms with
  applied modules for cheminformatics and bioinformatics: wrapper
  feature selection, hyperparameter optimization, ensemble weight
  optimization, evolutionary undersampling, and loaders for gene
  expression, molecular and drug-target datasets. Every algorithm is
  benchmarked under rotation and translation of the objective, and the
  resulting behaviour is documented per algorithm.
type: software
